{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command armies, create strategies, and dominate the battlefield!</strong><br>In this real-time strategy game, you take on the role of commander and control every movement of your soldiers. Select troops, organize formations, and give precise orders to turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/b70cb61ab3c3e275c67cfa7a84937abb.poster.avif?t=1767956356\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/b70cb61ab3c3e275c67cfa7a84937abb.webm?t=1767956356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/b70cb61ab3c3e275c67cfa7a84937abb.mp4?t=1767956356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose where they should move, attack specific enemies, or even automatically distribute targets to ensure no enemy is left standing. Every command can decide victory or defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/9cbdba5bcde07afb1e4bb9286809eba9.poster.avif?t=1767956356\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/9cbdba5bcde07afb1e4bb9286809eba9.webm?t=1767956356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/9cbdba5bcde07afb1e4bb9286809eba9.mp4?t=1767956356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also lock unit movement to defend critical positions on the map. If you notice that weaker soldiers are vulnerable, send stronger warriors to stand beside them. By holding their position, these guardians automatically strike any enemy that gets close, creating protection zones that can change the course of the battle. This allows you to build small defensive lines, protect archers, and stabilize threatened flanks \u2014 all with just a few clicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/4c4ae213de17f1431ff725cfdf28caf8.poster.avif?t=1767956356\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/4c4ae213de17f1431ff725cfdf28caf8.webm?t=1767956356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/4c4ae213de17f1431ff725cfdf28caf8.mp4?t=1767956356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign:</strong> progress through campaigns composed of 5 unique rounds, each bringing increasingly strategic enemies and greater challenges. Survive them all to claim final victory.<br><strong>Sandbox:</strong> unleash your creativity. Choose units, place them wherever you want, and create epic scenarios \u2014 from balanced encounters to total chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/c298a3bb0880e29cd9eaac15634a65e3.poster.avif?t=1767956356\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/c298a3bb0880e29cd9eaac15634a65e3.webm?t=1767956356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/c298a3bb0880e29cd9eaac15634a65e3.mp4?t=1767956356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a variety of soldiers, each with unique abilities and behaviors, the game offers countless ways to build your army and develop strategies. You can combine different fighting styles, create specific formations for each situation, and test new tactics freely in Sandbox mode. Everything is accompanied by a dynamic soundtrack that shifts between calm moments and intense battles to heighten immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Soldiers United","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4006170/b15a8022755800273aa755e035d80747e0a46bf0.jpg"},{"name":"Rise of the Squires","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4006170/4e37ba08e340ad65d71e530955622780906a0f3e.jpg"},{"name":"March of the Hoplites","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4006170/cd24e44fec3843533216bc70addf0aa7b85bdc7f.jpg"},{"name":"Masters of the Bow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4006170/500914715c95d3d605a846264b4bd8c10d4d834d.jpg"},{"name":"War Machines Unleashed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4006170/e79e838fae77c182900a5b7b32107176ed17f5d0.jpg"},{"name":"Crush the Green Horde","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4006170/235fdaf5ee20772a0190189af86938181bed27f9.jpg"},{"name":"Honor of the Mountainfolk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4006170/0df3e5bbde90d20bb61bd483a52e8fecb432c208.jpg"},{"name":"Total Domination","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4006170/8b09003d76dadbb1df91ea820bc2d2e55c8428eb.jpg"},{"name":"Grand Commander","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4006170/2122ba1b44c32906a154e93ee92b778bd248bc32.jpg"},{"name":"Chosen by the Light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4006170/1a934c92f9f0d788f20ca3ba11702c1aed827416.jpg"}],"total":25},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4006170?t=1767956356","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4006170?t=1767956356","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/19ac7e8a0388da2b6c42eb576a6d4b7fb18ea155/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767956356","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/19ac7e8a0388da2b6c42eb576a6d4b7fb18ea155/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767956356","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4316690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command armies, create strategies, and dominate the battlefield!</strong><br>In this real-time strategy game, you take on the role of commander and control every movement of your soldiers. Select troops, organize formations, and give precise orders to turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/b70cb61ab3c3e275c67cfa7a84937abb.poster.avif?t=1767956356\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/b70cb61ab3c3e275c67cfa7a84937abb.webm?t=1767956356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/b70cb61ab3c3e275c67cfa7a84937abb.mp4?t=1767956356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose where they should move, attack specific enemies, or even automatically distribute targets to ensure no enemy is left standing. Every command can decide victory or defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/9cbdba5bcde07afb1e4bb9286809eba9.poster.avif?t=1767956356\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/9cbdba5bcde07afb1e4bb9286809eba9.webm?t=1767956356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/9cbdba5bcde07afb1e4bb9286809eba9.mp4?t=1767956356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also lock unit movement to defend critical positions on the map. If you notice that weaker soldiers are vulnerable, send stronger warriors to stand beside them. By holding their position, these guardians automatically strike any enemy that gets close, creating protection zones that can change the course of the battle. This allows you to build small defensive lines, protect archers, and stabilize threatened flanks \u2014 all with just a few clicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/4c4a